                <pb facs="0227" n="217" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg217"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3531/520: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-10-04T13:00:00-04:00">October 4, 1937—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>188. In view of efforts now being made in endeavor to secure in more definite
                    form Argentine exchange proposal, I am deferring for the present delivery of
                    suggested confidential memorandum contained in Department’s 91, September 30, 5
                    p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Weddell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
